For a purchase order exceeding twenty million (20 000 000 Rfw) the performance guarantee must be submitted according to  Ministerial Order n° 001/23/10/ TC of 10/10/2023 establishing regulations governing public procurement 
Amount to be requested according to purchase order given:
5% of the value of the purchase order whose value exceed FRW 500,000,000; 
6% of the value of the purchase order whose is  between FRW 100,000,000 FRW to FRW 500,000,000;
 7% of the value of the purchase order whose value is between  FRW 50,000,000 to FRW 100,000,000; 
 10% of the value of the purchase order whose value is between  FRW 20,000,000 to FRW 50,000,000.

