Twelve (12) Calendar months from contract signature date by both parties, (renewable two times based on performance and availability of funds).

The Defects Liability Period shall be defined depending on the value of service orders issued within a year: 
a.	the defect liability period of 6 months if the value of service orders issued does not exceed FRW 100,000,000; 
b.	the defect liability period of ten months if the value of service orders issued exceeds FRW 100,000,000 but not exceeding FRW 500,000,000; 
c.	the defect liability period of 15 months if the value of service orders issued exceeds FRW 500,000,000 but not exceeding FRW 5,000,000,000; 
d.	the defect liability period of twenty-One months if the value of service orders issued exceeds FRW 5,000,000,000; 

The period is countered from the Completion Date/ provisional handover of the works indicated in the Administrative Order (s).

